Z||000000||CUTTER||05-29-2000||10:46 PM||||Well I raced a early 90's voltswagon GTI 4cyl 16 valve and LOST by over a car length. What the heck is up with that? shouldnt are 2.8's beat those 4cyl VW's? I raced plenty of scirocco 16V and kicked the crap outa them. And the worst part about tonights race with the GTI was......THE DRIVER WAS A GIRL!<BR>that torked my buttons. I was pretty mad! it was a 5 speed, and she said it was all stock. Which it was because I checked it out. I even have accell wires and a flowmaster with k&n air filter. Whats up with this?||||reg||8
Z||000001||GT Bastard||05-30-2000||12:10 AM||||Hehe, the earlier Scirroco's ranked at around 70hp, so don't get too excited.  Even the 16valve cars were pretty slow.||||reg||1
Z||000002||Wannabe||05-30-2000||12:16 AM||||BIG difference between the 1.8L Scirocco and the 2.0L GTI. The 1.8 barely broke into the 16's, the 2.0 was good for high 15's.||||reg||1
