Z||000008||Eric||05-31-2000||08:26 AM||||I drove one of those around for about a month.  That little thing was kind of a fun car.  The torque was very strong for a 2.0 four and it had good top end too.  I think it would have lost to my Fiero in a race to 50 or so, but after that I think it would pull away.||||reg||1
